    "text": "Whether Mr. G. W. Nandasiri who had worked as a Conductor of the Sri Lanka Transport Board had been caused injustice bybeen compulsorily retired at the age of 57 years and 6 months and been reinstated in employment on 07.05.2015 without paywhilst the retirement age of Public Enterprises had been extended up to 60 years with effect from 01.01.2013 by PublicEnterprises Circular No. 01/2013 dated 15.01.2013 and if such injustice has been caused, to what relief he is entitled.",
